<title>GERMANY: Kohl to make Europe policy speech on Dec 12.</title>
<headline>Kohl to make Europe policy speech on Dec 12.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Chancellor Helmut Kohl said on Wednesday he would spell out his European policies in a policy speech to the Bonn parliament on December 12, the eve of the European Union's summit in Dublin.</p>
<p>Kohl said during the annual budget debate that parliament would be able to debate European issues at that time.</p>
<p>The chancellor plans to meet French President Jacques Chirac in Nuremberg on December 9 to coordinate policies before the Dublin summit.</p>
</text>
